■ JCROSS_FRAG_b4b8680b
【状態】 確定
【主体】 script
【関係】 will
【客体】 repeatedly ask user for string to transmit send it over first serial port receive reply over second serial port ask for another reply string until user decides to quit application by entering n when prompted

[L2_Archive]
This script will repeatedly ask the user for a string to transmit, send it over the first serial port, receive the reply over the second serial port, and then ask for another reply string, until the user decides to quit the application by entering "n" when prompted.

